[NARRATIVE]
UID: NAR-WHITEBOARD-VIEW-PIPELINE
TITLE: From the canon to the page
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
WIDGET: stack
PLACE: section
STATEMENT: >>>
Four steps, top to bottom, run by one task; each reads only what the step above it wrote.

- export: strictdoc export: every .sdoc under the repository, parsed and validated into one JSON export in a clean directory; the task that runs it is [LINK: MECH-VIEW-TASK] [BUILT]
- check: view-check: the rules a tree of narratives must satisfy that the parser does not check, per root, count first; a finding lands on the page and a bad root stops the task ([LINK: MECH-VIEW-CHECK]) [BUILT]
- wireline: one payload: every root's tree with each statement parsed per its widget, a card per node, every edge, every backlink, the grammar and the check findings ([LINK: MECH-VIEW-WIRELINE]) [BUILT]
- render: one page: the payload spliced into a content-blind template, written twice -- a standalone page and the artifact host's shape ([LINK: MECH-VIEW-RENDERER]) [BUILT]
<<<
PARENT_FP: >>>
MECH-VIEW-CHECK:0000000
MECH-VIEW-RENDERER:0000000
MECH-VIEW-TASK:0000000
MECH-VIEW-WIRELINE:0000000
<<<
